# SceneShift global

- iOS: Swift/SwiftUI/RoomPlan only; no CocoaPods, no FastAPI template clone, no `backend/` or `frontend/`
- `scripts/`: Node 22.13+, npm, not Bun; `@cursor/sdk` pinned (never `latest`); never commit `CURSOR_API_KEY`
- Read `AGENTS.md` + `PROGRESS.md` before multi-file work; implement the current task only
- LiDAR device tests are `[device-only]`; do not block PRs on them
- YAGNI: only files listed in the current plan task
- One branch per task: `feat/task-N-short-name`; update `PROGRESS.md` before every push

```text
❌ BAD: clone fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template, add Podfile, use Bun, start Task N+1 unapproved
✅ GOOD: RoomPlan + SPM system frameworks; wait for user approval between tasks
```
